WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.010
I'm Ed Bannon,

2
00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:06.000
a lifelong Northwest sider and a proud dad of three CPS graduates.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.080
I know the pride in great teachers,

4
00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.030
the frustration of under-resourced classrooms,

5
00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:13.010
and the need for a school board that listens.

6
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.090
For more than a decade as a volunteer, I've worked alongside parents, teachers,

7
00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:20.030
and our community to make a difference for our students.

8
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:24.020
And I'm not backed by billionaires who want to privatize our schools and profit

9
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:28.070
off of our children. Vote Ed Bannon for school board on or before November 3rd.
